# Galen translation of demo/gallery/index.html's layout-lint spec (26
# constraints), for the cross-runner comparison.
#
# Mechanical translation policy (no per-rule judgment):
#   - layout-lint's directional minimum-gap form (`above X 0px` = at least
#     0px) becomes Galen's relation with an explicit `> -2px` bound: the
#     baseline run showed Galen's integer rectangles reading a shared edge
#     as -1px, which layout-lint's built-in 1px tolerance admits and
#     Galen's zero-tolerance default rejects. The -2px bound applies the
#     same approximation constant used for the equalities below.
#   - exact equalities (`width 184px`, `same-width`) become Galen's
#     approximate range `~`, which applies the configured approximation
#     (galen.range.approximation = 2px, Galen's documented default), because
#     Galen measures integer rectangles and a probe run showed exact values
#     failing on 1px rounding.
#   - range and comparator forms translate one to one.
#   - `same-width A B` becomes `width ~ 100% of B/width` on A.
#   - `taller-than` becomes `height > 100% of .../height`.
#
# The group broadcast `@room visible` expands to its four members'
# `visible` checks below, mirroring the rule extractor's own expansion.
# Not translatable (recorded for the expressiveness delta):
# `badge not inside header` — Galen's parser rejects `not` as an unknown
# spec and the language has no general negation of a spatial relation
# (absence of an element, via `absent`, is its one negative form).

@objects
    header          #header
    nav             #nav
    gallery         #gallery
    footer          #footer
    card-*          .artwork
    badge           #featured-badge
    searchbox       #search-box
    artwork-1       #artwork-1
    artwork-1-image #artwork-1-image
    artwork-1-info  #artwork-1-info

= Skeleton =
    header:
        above nav > -2px
        visible

    nav:
        visible

    gallery:
        below nav > -2px
        visible

    footer:
        below gallery > -2px
        visible

= Wall =
    card-1:
        inside gallery
        width ~ 100% of card-2/width
        left-of card-2

    card-2:
        inside gallery
        width ~ 100% of card-3/width
        right-of card-1 40 to 80px

    card-3:
        inside gallery
        right-of card-2 40 to 80px

= Plate =
    artwork-1-image:
        height > 100% of artwork-1-info/height
        width ~ 100% of artwork-1/width

    artwork-1-info:
        width 95 to 100% of artwork-1/width

= Badge =
    badge:
        inside gallery
        inside partly gallery
        width ~ 184px
        width < 185px
        height > 60px
        height < 240px

= Search =
    searchbox:
        inside nav
